 steal at 100% effectiveness.Aatrox heals for 100% of the post-mitigation bonus damage dealt, reduced to 25% against minions.","Whenever Aatrox hits at least one enemy champion or large monster with a basic attack on-hit or an ability, the cooldown of Deathbringer Stance is reduced by 2 seconds, modified to 4 if he hits with the Sweetspot of The Darkin Blade."]}]},{"slot":"Q","variants":[{"name":"The Darkin Blade","rows":[{"attribute":"First Cast Damage","modifiers":[{"values":[10,25,40,55,70],"units":["","","","",""]},{"values":[60,67.5,75,82.5,90],"units":["% AD","% AD","% AD","% AD","% AD"]}]},{"attribute":"First Sweetspot Damage","modifiers":[{"values":[17,42.5,68,93.5,119],"units":["","","","",""]},{"values":[102,114.75,127.5,140.25,153],"units":["% AD","% AD","% AD","% AD","% AD"]}]},{"attribute":"Second Cast Damage","modifiers":[{"values":[12.5,31.25,50,68.75,87.5],"units":["","","","",""]},{"values":[75,84.375,93.75,103.125,112.5],"units":["% AD","% AD","% AD","% AD","% AD"]}]},{"attribute":"Second Sweetspot Damage","modifiers":[{"values":[21.25,53.125,85,116.875,148.75],"units":["","","","",""]},{"values":[127.5,143.4375,159.375,175.3125,191.25],"units":["% AD","% AD","% AD","% AD","% AD"]}]},{"attribute":"Third Cast Damage","modifiers":[{"values":[15,37.5,60,82.5,105],"units":["","","","",""]},{"values":[90,101.25,112.5,123.75,135],"units":["% AD","% AD","% AD","% AD","% AD"]}]},{"attribute":"Third Sweetspot Damage","modifiers":[{"values":[25.5,63.75,102,140.25,178.5],"units":["","","","",""]},{"values":[153,172.125,191.25,210.375,229.5],"units":["% AD","% AD","% AD","% AD","% AD"]}]},{"attribute":"Maximum Non-Minion Non-Sweetspot Damage","modifiers":[{"values":[37.5,93.75,150,206.25,262.5],"units":["","","","",""]},{"values":[225,253.125,281.25,309.375,337.5],"units":["% AD","% AD","% AD","% AD","% AD"]}]},{"attribute":"Maximum Non-Minion Sweetspot Damage","modifiers":[{"values":[63.75,159.375,255,350.625,446.25],"units":["","","","",""]},{"values":[382.5